NAME
    move - Move or rename a file or directory. Same-filesystem moves use the provider rename operation; cross-filesystem files fall back to copy then delete.

SYNOPSIS
    move <source> <destination>

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Move or rename a file or directory. Same-filesystem moves use the provider rename operation; cross-filesystem files fall back to copy then delete.

FAT NAME SUPPORT
    The current Inu FAT provider creates and renames entries using FAT 8.3 short names.
    Long-file-name creation and rename are reserved for a later filesystem-provider extension.

EXAMPLES
    move OLD.TXT NEW.TXT
    move LOG.TXT \ARCHIVE

FILES
    /System/Commands/MOVE.CMD
    /INU/HELP/MOVE.MAN
